{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"3011","title":"Redmi 12 5G: The Ultimate Entry-Level 5G Powerhouse","desc":"Experience 5G convenience at an accessible price","view_cnt":"14659","like_cnt":"3","add_time":"1693473609","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/853_operatorx_operatorx_opx/31/08/2023/a278a4f02e5fdc7f7772c6d18da80ecc.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBeijing, CHINA, September 1 \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e-\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eToday, Xiaomi introduces Redmi 12 5G, the ultimate entry-level powerhouse offering seamless 5G connectivity, elegant design, and exceptional user experiences for a starting price from USD 199.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/51_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/31/08/2023/14070c27c74f6337d7c37b2fa4fc2915.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePowered by Snapdragon® 4 Gen 2 Mobile Platform, Redmi 12 5G boasts a 4nm processor with two performance cores and six efficiency cores, delivering speeds up to 2.2GHz and 2.0GHz, respectively. Supporting up to 16GB RAM with memory extension, you can experience flagship-level performance and the speed of 5G at an affordable price. Additionally, Redmi 12 5G supports expandable storage of up to 1TB,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e¹\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e keeping all your favorite apps, games, and content at your fingertips.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAvailable in three stunning colors - Midnight Black, Sky Blue, and Polar Silver, Redmi 12 5G stands out from the competition with a premium glass back and infinite camera deco design. Coming in at only 8.17mm\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e²\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e thin, the phone not only looks great but also offers an incredible hand feel. Boasting a large 6.79” FHD+ DotDisplay screen and a 2460x1080 resolution, Redmi 12 5G offers an immersive viewing experience to fulfill all your entertainment needs, making it perfect for gaming and watching videos. The phone is SGS Low Blue Light certified³ along with the latest Reading mode 3.0, allowing readers to enjoy content for longer without eye fatigue. Additionally, with its IP53 rating,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e⁴\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e Redmi 12 5G is built to handle everyday dust and splashes.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eRedmi 12 5G features a dual camera system comprising a powerful 50MP main camera and a 2MP depth camera that delivers natural-looking bokeh and uplifts the authenticity of your photos. With Redmi 12 5G, you can unleash your photographic creativity in HDR mode, night mode, or portrait mode and capture videos with movie frame or time-lapse mode. Enjoy seven popular filmCamera filters to boost your photography game with pixel-level calculations and real-time previews.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eTo keep you connected, Redmi 12 5G has an 18W Type-C fast charging port\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e⁵\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e and a powerful 5,000mAh battery to keep you going throughout the day, supporting up to 23 days of standby, 179 hours of music, 32 hours of reading, or 27 hours of video playback.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e⁶\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e Redmi 12 5G also supports a 3.5mm headphone jack and NFC⁷ for extra convenience and can even act as an IR remote control for your other devices at home.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eRedmi 12 5G comes in three variants - 4GB+128GB, 8GB+128GB, and 8GB+256GB, with 4GB+128GB starting at USD 199. Pricing may vary between markets.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eProduct images available \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"Hyperlink SCXW1187242 BCX0\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/Euk_Kt03fiBLqpMZisEkXVoBwlLEDNL5GOrO5iBZE4AEdg?e=ZDCCyr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ehere\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eENDS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e1. Configurations available may differ between different regions. Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e2. Actual measurements between individual products may vary. All specifications are subject to the actual product.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e3. Data retrieved from SGS test report.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e4. The device with IP53 has been tested to be resistant to splash and dust in the presence of specific laboratory conditions with the classification IP53 ingress protection based on IEC 60529:1989+A1:1999+A2:2013\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e5. Power adapter is sold separately in certain regions. For optimal charging efficiency, we recommend using power adapters that support 18W PD charging, or Xiaomi official power adapters of 18W or above if available.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e6. Data from Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual battery life may vary depending on network environment, usage patterns and other factors. The maximum capacity of the battery will naturally decrease with time and usage.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e7. NFC availability may vary between markets.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://1810.HK\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e1810.HK\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eEmbracing our vision of “Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users’ hearts”, Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi is one of the world's leading smartphone companies. In June 2023, MAU of MIUI reached approximately 606 million globally. The company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, reached 654.5 million smart devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops and tablets) as of June 30, 2023. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In August 2023, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the fifth year in a row, ranking 360th. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eFor more information about Xiaomi as a company, please visit \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/discover/newsroom\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ehttps://www.mi.com/global/discover/newsroom\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"3540","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1693533600"},"common":null}